---
import PageLayout from '@/layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import ContactLink from '@/components/ui/ContactLink.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/config/site';
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${SITE.title} handles your data.`} updated="11 November 2026">
  <p>
    {SITE.title} is a personal notebook. It is a static website: there are no accounts, no comments, no forms and
    no newsletter, so you are never asked for any personal information.
  </p>

  <h2>What this site does not do</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>It does not use cookies.</li>
    <li>It does not use analytics, tracking pixels or advertising.</li>
    <li>
      It does not load anything from third parties. The fonts and photographs are served from this site itself, so
      your browser does not contact Google Fonts, Unsplash or any other service while you read.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>What is stored on your device</h2>
  <p>
    If you choose the light or dark theme, that choice is saved in your browser's local storage under the key
    <code>theme</code>, so the site looks the same on your next visit. It never leaves your device, and you can
    remove it at any time by clearing this site's data in your browser settings.
  </p>

  <h2>Server logs</h2>
  <p>
    Like most websites, the hosting provider may keep short-lived technical logs of requests, such as IP address,
    browser type and the page requested. These are used only to keep the service running and secure, and are not
    used to identify or profile readers.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    Some entries link to other websites. Those sites have their own privacy practices, which this policy does not
    cover.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
  <p>
    If this policy changes, the date at the top of the page will be updated. For any questions, get in touch through{" "}
    <ContactLink />.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
